                          "font-size": "16px",
                          "font-weight": "400",
                          "width": "var(--container-widget-width,65%)",
                          "max-width": "65%",
                          "--container-widget-width": "65%"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "text",
                      "html": "<p>When navigating landlord and tenant board litigation, it is vital to carefully consider your approach to resolving disputes. Seeking guidance from a seasoned legal professional specializing in landlord and tenant board matters is crucial to identify the most effective strategies and ensure a favourable resolution tailored to the specific circumstances of each case.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
